## ObjectType: Issuer Exposure

Portfolio/issuer/date market-value share of complete portfolio securities assets; cash, NAV and regulatory capital are outside the denominator. Any unpriced position blocks all issuer shares.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| exposure_id | Exposure Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | exposure_id |
| portfolio_id | Portfolio Id | string | Foreign key to portfolios; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | portfolio_id |
| issuer_id | Issuer Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | issuer_id |
| as_of_date | As Of Date | date | Business snapshot date, distinct from quote/fixing date and date of knowledge. | as_of_date |
| exposure_status | Exposure Status | string | Explicit controlled state/reason; absence never implies completion or acceptance. Allowed values: blocked, complete. | exposure_status |
| exposure_amount | Exposure Amount | decimal | Recorded issuer numerator may be blank under snapshot-wide controls. Reconstruction preserves the issuer amount when all its contributions are known, even if another issuer blocks the portfolio denominator. Proved zero is zero; uncovered holdings cannot be zero-filled. | exposure_amount |
| denominator_amount | Denominator Amount | decimal | All securities-position USD values in this portfolio/date, excluding cash. Any unknown contribution makes the total unknown; a proved zero total remains zero but does not define an issuer ratio. | denominator_amount |
| ratio | Ratio | decimal | Issuer numerator divided by complete securities-asset denominator, 0–1 ratio, 6dp; not percent points or NAV share. | ratio |
| currency | Currency | string | Base currency USD; amounts are expressed in dollars. | currency |
| view_kind | View Kind | string | actual is a synthetic observed fact; planned is an explicit forecast known at the observation date, never actual future completion. Allowed values: actual, planned. | view_kind |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: exposure_id
